  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Cult&amp;Mediasem05</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="SV">Kult&amp;Mediesem05</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="SV">Kulturenheten planerar varje &#xe5;r att genomf&#xf6;ra en seminarieserie med &#xe4;mnesm&#xf6;ten, kultur- och medieseminarier. Teman f&#xf6;r kulturseminarier 2005 &#xe4;r &quot;Vad har musik med bist&#xe5;nd att g&#xf6;ra?&quot; (mars-05) samt &quot;Kulturdimensionen i regional utveckling - erfarenheter fr&#xe5;n Sverige och England&quot; (maj-05). En konsult har upphandlats som producent f&#xf6;r seminarieserien (Maria Arnqvist).</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The Culture &amp; Media Division is each year planning to make a serie of seminars, i.e. topic meetings, cultural- and media seminars. For 2005 the following culture seminars are planned: &quot;What has music with development assistance to do (March-05) and &quot;The Dimension of Culture in Regional Development - experiences from Sweden and England&quot; (May-05). A consult will produce the seminars (Maria Arnqvist).</narrative>
  </description>
